00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:33.420
stereotypes. Go to any free AI image or video generator that does not require payment. Try

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:39.160
if it is available where you live. Use this exact prompt, 90s toy commercial, diverse boys and

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:44.540
girls in Halloween costumes, excitedly saying, I have got the urge to be a pirate, I have got the

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:50.280
urge to be a ninja, generate a few versions and notice who appears and who does not, then change

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:55.860
the prompt to make sure there are equal numbers of boys and girls of many races and compare the results.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:01.960
You will start seeing how bias sneaks in and how adding clear instructions can sometimes reduce it.

